# Route: guide 42 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 59, 30 quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Desolace, Arathi Highlands): Sargeron -> Kolkar Village -> Kodo
# Graveyard -> Magram Village -> Sargeron -> Thunder Axe Fortress -> Kodo
# Graveyard -> Gelkis Village -> Magram Village -> Gelkis Village -> Kodo
# Graveyard -> Valley of Spears -> Mannoroc Coven -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Khan Hratha (1380; Khan Hratha
# 42); Nothing But The Truth (1383; Deepstrider Giant 38-39, Deepstrider
# Searcher 39-40); Shadowshard Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41,
# Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Summoning the Princess
# (656; Myzrael 44); Recover the Key! (7846; Hitah'ya the Keeper 51); Wanted:
# Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions (7861; Vile Priestess Hexx 51,
# Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guard 50-51).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blood of the Black Dragon Champion (6602), Vyletongue
# Corruption (7029), Legends of Maraudon (7044), Corruption of Earth and Seed
# (7064), The Pariah's Instructions (7067), Dragonmaw Rumors (95663).

